* Standard ngspice init file
alias exit quit
alias acct rusage all
set x11lineararcs
*set rndseed=12
** ascii rawfile **
set filetype=ascii
** frontend debug output **
*set ngdebug
** asking after quit **
*set askquit
** set the number of threads in openmp
** default (if compiled with --enable-openmp) is: 2
set num_threads=8
*set interactive

* Kessetsu ships a minimal manufacturer-model runtime profile. analog.cm and
* xtradev.cm supply the transfer and analog-switch models used by ngspice's
* PSpice translation. Other optional XSPICE and all OpenVAF/OSDI models remain
* outside this bundle.
if $?xspice_enabled
 codemodel ../lib/ngspice/analog.cm
 codemodel ../lib/ngspice/xtradev.cm
end
unset osdi_enabled
